answers.approach:
Stop auditing ghosts —
spend is the switch, always on;
decay what we learned.

Hush now, choose one spend decision, not one truth for all display;
Name its outcome, clock, and action ere the models have their say.

Keep a neutral event spine, and log each platform shift in time;
Run small switchbacks, ghosts, or geos only where the power can climb.

Pool those trials to grade—not crown—a drifting causal-model choir;
Publish blind benchmarks and honest bounds, not certainty for hire.

When the holdouts whisper faintly, “unknown” may be the truest view;
The box keeps changing as we measure, so the song stays unsolved too.
